   "jp": "「独断は禁物です。@　ここは彼の身柄を拘束すべきでは？」",
   "en": "Acting on your own is forbidden.@Shouldn't we take him into custody instead?",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false
  },
  {
   "id": 270,
   "jp": "「ふん……なら、お前に３分の時間をやる」",
   "en": "Hmph... Then I'll give you three minutes.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false
  },
  {
   "id": 271,
   "jp": "「了解。@　……そこのあなた、所属と官姓名を述べなさい」",
