   "jp": "「名乗らないのであれば、それでも構いませんが……@　直ちに武装解除し、投降しなさい」",
   "en": "If you will not identify yourself, that is fine as well...@But disarm immediately and surrender.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false
  },
  {
   "id": 273,
